cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use TamerOp in your research, please cite this software and record
  the version or Git commit used for your analysis.
type: software
title: "TamerOp.jl: Computing with persistence modules and finite posets"
authors:
  - family-names: Novak
    given-names: Erik
repository-code: "https://github.com/erikmnovak/TamerOp.jl"
url: "https://github.com/erikmnovak/TamerOp.jl"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  TamerOp is a Julia library for finite encodings of persistence modules,
  homology, invariants, derived functors, and mathematical visualization.
keywords:
  - persistence modules
  - multiparameter persistence
  - computational topology
  - homological algebra
  - Julia
